# Always stop terminals

The user does not want leftover terminals. Do this every time without being asked:

- After any `npm run dev`, test, install, or other shell command, **stop that process** before you finish the turn.
- Kill Next.js / Node servers on ports 3000 and 3001 (and any other ports you started).
- Do not leave a watcher or background shell running at the end of a reply.
- Never wait for the user to say “stop the terminal.”
